# expert-programmer

[![Build Status](https://travis-ci.com/zebbra/expert-programmer.svg?branch=master)](https://travis-ci.com/zebbra/expert-programmer)

## About

A Java program I wrote to help me learn the expert programmer mindset by creating a program to parse a "template" and print it according to the expert programmer's style. Given the template is in a file, the program outputs the template to the console. The template is a simple HTML file containing one system, user, and assistant string.

The program uses the Java WebStart API to handle downloading the jar file to a specified directory and then runs the program in a new virtual machine environment.

