* If the template file contains <user> it will not be replaced by the user's input.
* If the template file contains <system> it will be replaced by the name of the system (e.g. Windows, Mac OS, Linux, etc.)
* If the template file contains <assistant> it will be replaced by the name of a helper assistant.
