First of all, I think it would be better if you know how to create a menu. It's easy, but it's good to know that it is possible.

Now that we know how to create menus, we can continue on with the tutorial and let's get started.

In the tutorial, we will ask for a user name and ask him what he wants to do in the quiz game, depending on the choice he made. We are going to make two games: one of them will be a game with true and false answers and the other will be a multiple choice quiz.

## 2. Creating the project

In NetBeans, go to **File > New Project** and choose **Java Project with Ant Build System**. Enter a project name and click **Finish**.

