Sum Two Numbers
============================

Write a program to calculate the sum `n + 1` of all odd numbers from `1` to `n`. Do not print the result.

## Examples

| n    | result |
|------|--------|
| 1    | 3      |
| 2    | 5      |
| 3    | 2 + 4  |
| 4    | 1 + 3 + 5 + 7 |

*/

public class Solution {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int number = Integer.parseInt(args[0]);
        int result = 0;
        for(int i = 1; i <= number; i++){
            if(i % 2 == 1) {
                result += i;
            }
        }
        System.out.println(result);
    }
}

